[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614698397","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102068#issuecomment-2614698397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102068","id":2614698397,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b2SGd","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T01:29:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T01:33:08Z","body":"What is your use case?\r\n\r\nI'm trying to find the original reason this wasn't exposed.\r\n\r\nI'm curious if the team plans to change the algorithm since there are multiple at least h-vacd and coacd.\r\n\r\nEdited:\r\n\r\nThis internal function doesn't have a type, so it can't be correct to expose it as is since there are multiple convex decomposition algorithms in the literature. \r\n\r\nThis needs a proposal.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614698397/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614739927","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102068#issuecomment-2614739927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102068","id":2614739927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b2cPX","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T02:26:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T02:26:12Z","body":"> I'm curious if the team plans to change the algorithm since there are multiple at least h-vacd and coacd.\r\n> \r\n> Edited:\r\n> \r\n> This internal function doesn't have a type, so it can't be correct to expose it as is since there are multiple convex decomposition algorithms in the literature.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn `Mesh::convex_decompose` it only returns instances of ConvexPolygonShape3D, and its always done that since the method was added back in [2019](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/5823b5d77d47339c3c981953ca8178e7ef14b6df#diff-e84616c8a1b4f2029ec6cc009fb3ed17f43d699e1f9125d8023c5ce9b65e66a8). So it shouldn't be a problem if the exposed function returns a more explicit type. \r\n\r\nAnd If another algorithm was added, it would be added via Mesh::convex_decomposition_function, so it wouldn't change the types\r\n\r\nBut if its easier I can just change the type to be Shape3D instead.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614739927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]